==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|resorbere|lang=la}}, from {{term|re-||again|lang=la}} + {{term|sorbere||to suck in|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive}} to [[absorb]] (something) again
# {{intransitive}} to undergo [[resorption]]
# {{biology|transitive}} to [[dissolve]] something and [[assimilate]] it

